OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after boy dies in motorbike
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 15-year-old boy has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of causing death by dangerous
OL,8,Fdriving after a teenager was killed in
OL,9,Fan electric motorbike crash.
OL,11,FA 16-year-old boy, who police believe
OL,12,Fwas a passenger on the back of the
OL,13,Fbike, died at the scene at East Reach
OL,14,Fin Taunton, Somerset at 22:20 BST on 1
OL,15,FOctober.
OL,17,FAvon and Somerset Police said the boy
OL,18,Farrested is suspected of riding the
OL,19,Felectric motorbike when it collided
OL,20,Fwith a car which had stopped at traffic
OL,21,Flights near the junction with Haydon
OL,22,FRoad.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
